    <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 15, left: 60, width: 735, fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', letterSpacing: 1 }}>主对比：三个设置、八个基线</Text>
    <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 23, left: 800, width: 200, fontSize: 15, color: '#BBD9F2', textAlign: 'right' }}>03 · <span style={{ color: '#FFF2CC', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>阶段 1</span> · 基准对比</Text>
    <Image src="assets/logo_bar.png" style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 8, left: 1010, width: 210, height: 44, objectFit: 'contain' }} />

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 74, left: 60, width: 1160, height: 614, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 18 }}>
            <Image src="assets/p_tab03.png" style={{ width: 1070, height: 265 }} />
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 8 }}>
            表 III　论文原表。数值为 5 次随机种子的均值±标准差；S2 = 25% 矩形禁区，S3 = 禁区面积 10%–50% 随机。
        </Text>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, marginTop: 24 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 373, padding: '14px 18px', background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D8DEE7', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#5A6675' }}>S1 均匀采样</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginTop: 6 }}>0.0043 = 0.0043</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>与 RME-GAN 完全打平，基础能力没有问题</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 373, padding: '14px 18px', background: '#FBF3F2', borderLeft: '4px solid #C0392B', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#5A6675' }}>S2　25% 盲区</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C0392B', marginTop: 6 }}>NMSE 低 11.8%</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>其余深度模型普遍退到 0.005–0.007</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 373, padding: '14px 18px', background: '#FBF3F2', borderLeft: '4px solid #C0392B', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#5A6675' }}>S3　10%–50% 盲区</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C0392B', marginTop: 6 }}>NMSE 低 16.4%</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>盲区越大，优势越明显</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ background: '#E8F0FA', borderLeft: '4px solid #123C6E', padding: '12px 20px', marginTop: 24 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
